#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:soor_website_homepage.soor_hessapay_page
msgid ""
"HessaPay is the GCC’s first social finance app designed to make splitting expenses effortless. Built in Kuwait and developed by Soor Technologies, the app helps friends, families, and groups track shared expenses, settle balances instantly, and manage activities — all in one smart, modern, and secure platform.\n"
"                                    Whether it’s dinners, padel matches, trips, jam’iya contributions, or everyday group expenses, HessaPay keeps everything organized, transparent, and stress-free."
